 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "I want to make sure we're clear on expectations and goals from the start.",
  "Salary increases and performance appraisals are important topics to address early on.",
  "Your performance will be reviewed periodically, and salary adjustments will be based on your contributions and the impact you make at the company.",
  "From now on, I need you to ensure that all method names end with '_a'.",
  "For variable names, they should always start with 'm_' as the prefix.",
  "This is a specific coding standard I'd like you to follow for this project.",
  "Consistency and adherence to standards are crucial.",
  "Once you're comfortable with the code structure, we can discuss your specific tasks and goals for the coming weeks.",
  "If you need to start early one day to accommodate an appointment or personal matter, do so, but ensure your work is on track.",
  "Communicate with your team, especially me, so we're all on the same page and can support each other.",
  "Remember, this policy is in place to help you thrive both professionally and personally.",
  "Don't hesitate to discuss any scheduling concerns or questions with me.",
  "We're here to support you and ensure your experience at ZENITH is a positive and productive one.",
  "I want to emphasize the importance of concise commit messages.",
  "When you're describing your code changes, be brief and to the point.",
  "No long-winded explanations needed.",
  "In your code, I want you to start using the '@timer_class' decorator from the 'pedantic' module."
 ],
